summary:
  The address for places that show no label is whatever picture there is.

history:
  MPRIS and a cast device were handed the lookup's picture as it came.
  Measured on 2026-11-12: mpris:artUrl was the sleeve of another single
  while "Päiksepoolsel tänaval" played. trackArtUrl is empty unless the
  picture is the song's own cover. This mutant makes it the picture again.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ArtworkEngine.qml

find:
      readonly property string trackArtUrl: albumArtKind === "track" ? albumArtUrl : ""

replace:
      readonly property string trackArtUrl: albumArtUrl

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_artworkengine.qml::test_another_single_of_the_artist_is_another_release_and_never_the_songs_cover.
  Line-neutral.
